        "Preparing %lld items…": {
            "comment": "Progress sheet title while several items are extracted to a temporary place to share them. %lld = number of items. Never shown for a single item; in languages whose “one” form also covers 21, 31…, it still means several items. The ellipsis shows work in progress.",
            "extractionState": "manual",
